  "sourceTitle": "Pineapple Cream Cheese Cake",
  "sourceText": "Pineapple Cream Cheese Cake\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 27, 2009 - 11:27pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 cups flour\n2 cups sugar\n2 eggs\npinch salt\n2 teaspoons baking soda\n1 1/2 cups pecans\n20 ounces can crushed pineapple (include juice)\n9 ounces pkg. Philadelphia cream cheese\n1/2 stick butter\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n2 cups powdered sugar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix ingredients well and pour into long pan (9 x 13). 2 Bake at 350 degrees for 40 minutes. 3 Mix well and pour over warm cake. 4 Submitted by: Girard Imbrenda",
